    "updated_at": "2017-06-14T01:49:11Z",
    "body": "I think Gecko and Blink behavior, concatenating Text children, is reasonable.  If TEXTAREA needs to react to any textContent change, DOM mutation operations need to be notified to all of TEXTAREA ancestors, and it would slow down DOM mutation without TEXTAREA too.\r\n\r\nWebKit's behavior is almost same as Gecko and Blink internally.  It just returns textContent for defaultValue IDL attribute getter.",
